# Survival's way in, through the real keys, on the world a normal start makes:
#   tools/tour.sh tours/survival.tour
# Driftwood off the strand survival lays by the spawn, dead wood under a dead tree,
# a loose stone, then a fire laid with two presses of use, seen at night.
shot 01-spawn with land:coast
# Driftwood on the strand survival lays by the spawn. Named, not pinned to a
# coordinate: `at 136.0,213.5` stood in a pond, and the tour pressed use on open
# water and shot "driftwood taken" of a player who had taken nothing — green,
# for months (wave A2, the same hole as the keeper at noon).
near driftwood
press use 0.1
wait 0.45
shot 02-gathering-driftwood with prop:driftwood
await took 4
shot 03-driftwood-taken
# Dead wood under a dead tree: hold use and it gives twice.
near dead_tree
press use 3.2
await took 4
wait 0.3
shot 04-dead-wood-picked-over with prop:dead_tree
# A loose stone off each of two boulders (`near` moves on to the next one).
near boulder
press use 0.1
await took 14
near boulder
press use 0.1
await took 14
wait 0.4
shot 05-stone with prop:boulder
# Open ground: the first press asks and rings the spot, the second lays the fire.
# Named, not pinned — for the SECOND time in this one file. `at 143.5,205.5` was
# open coast when it was written; every landscape added since moved the island
# under it, and by the time anyone looked it stood in the BONELANDS beside a
# village noticeboard. So `use` was answered by the story (49_story runs before
# 50_survival and reaches 3 tiles, exactly as it should), the frame below was a
# picture of a noticeboard called "asked", and the fire was never laid. It went
# red at line 39 and stayed red for months, because 39 is the first line here
# that CLAIMS anything.
ground grass
walk 1,-1 0.08
press use 0.1
wait 0.3
shot 06-asked with station:hand
press use 0.1
wait 1.5
shot 07-fire-laid with station:fire
hour 21.5
wait 1.0
shot 08-fire-at-night with station:fire
# Lie down by it: the night passes and the fire has burnt through to morning.
press use 0.1
wait 1.0
shot 09-morning with station:fire
